		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>When the moon rises on the longest night of the year, all goblins are filled with a primal, fiery power that lasts until dawn. On this night, the fire goblins burn! Gouts of fire burst out of this muscled goblin’s mouth with each howling war cry. </i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14 (chainmail), <strong>HP</strong> 20, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 burning spear (near) +3 (1d8), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Keen Senses</strong>. Can’t be surprised.</p><p></p><p><strong>Immolate</strong>. When killed, all in near DC 12 DEX or 1d8 damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Art by Yuri Perkowski-Domingos, 2023</i></p>",
